* tb_adc3_points.cir -- R1 ADC revision 3: both slices in parallel, one held differential input per slot and slice.
* Slot s (sampling edge 0.6 us + s * 0.6 us): slice A samples vda (SIN path), slice B samples vdb (COS path).
* vda/vdb are PWL sources written by sim/r3/run_points3.py (value of slot s applied 550 ns before its edge).
* Inputs are linear E sources around the common mode CM (revision 3, R2-7: no B sources on the input path).
* Reference: REFLINES (ideal source, or r1_refbuf3 from an ideal 1.045 V bandgap node).
* Substitutions: CORNER TEMP VDD CM CORE TIMING OPTS TMAX TSTOP PWLA PWLB REFLINES SAVE RAW
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_ss
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib mos_ss
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib res_typ
.include schematic/r1_adc_r3.spice
.include sim/r3/r1_adc_timing_r3_vdd108.inc
.temp 125
.option reltol=1e-4 vntol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 method=trap klu rshunt=1e12 interp

Vdd vdd 0 1.08
Vref vref 0 1.0
Vcm vcm 0 0.6
Vda vda 0 PWL(0 -0.0016748 6.500000e-07 -0.0016748 6.600000e-07 -0.0014514 1.250000e-06 -0.0014514 1.260000e-06 -0.0012282 1.850000e-06 -0.0012282 1.860000e-06 -0.0010049 2.450000e-06 -0.0010049
+ 2.460000e-06 -0.0007815 3.050000e-06 -0.0007815 3.060000e-06 -0.0005583 3.650000e-06 -0.0005583 3.660000e-06 -0.0003349 4.250000e-06 -0.0003349 4.260000e-06 -0.0001117 4.850000e-06 -0.0001117
+ 4.860000e-06 0.0001117 5.450000e-06 0.0001117 5.460000e-06 0.0003349 6.050000e-06 0.0003349 6.060000e-06 0.0005583 6.650000e-06 0.0005583 6.660000e-06 0.0007815 7.250000e-06 0.0007815
+ 7.260000e-06 0.0010049 7.850000e-06 0.0010049 7.860000e-06 0.0012282 8.450000e-06 0.0012282 8.460000e-06 0.0014514 9.050000e-06 0.0014514 9.060000e-06 0.0016748)
Vdb vdb 0 PWL(0 -0.0015631 6.500000e-07 -0.0015631 6.600000e-07 -0.0013398 1.250000e-06 -0.0013398 1.260000e-06 -0.0011165 1.850000e-06 -0.0011165 1.860000e-06 -0.0008932 2.450000e-06 -0.0008932
+ 2.460000e-06 -0.0006699 3.050000e-06 -0.0006699 3.060000e-06 -0.0004466 3.650000e-06 -0.0004466 3.660000e-06 -0.0002233 4.250000e-06 -0.0002233 4.260000e-06 0.0000000 4.850000e-06 0.0000000
+ 4.860000e-06 0.0002233 5.450000e-06 0.0002233 5.460000e-06 0.0004466 6.050000e-06 0.0004466 6.060000e-06 0.0006699 6.650000e-06 0.0006699 6.660000e-06 0.0008932 7.250000e-06 0.0008932
+ 7.260000e-06 0.0011165 7.850000e-06 0.0011165 7.860000e-06 0.0013398 8.450000e-06 0.0013398 8.460000e-06 0.0015631 9.050000e-06 0.0015631 9.060000e-06 0.0017864)
Esp sinp vcm vda 0 0.5
Esn sinn vcm vda 0 -0.5
Ecp cosp vcm vdb 0 0.5
Ecn cosn vcm vdb 0 -0.5
Vip isap 0 0.6
Vin isan 0 0.6

XADC sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isap isan trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 mclk wina winb lata latb
+ stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13
+ rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref 0 r1_adc3_core_fast

.control
set num_threads=1
save v(rawa) v(rawb)
tran 1n 9.9000u 0 0.2n
meas tran idd avg i(vdd) from=0.7u to=9.9000u
write <G1_RESULTS_ROOT>/r1_adc/r3-win-ss125-c2048/codes.raw
.endc
